WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,080
I killed someone

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:07,220
If you don't kill him, he will kill us too

3
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:11,820
Lulu, is that sword just now your usual power?

4
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:15,020
No, it's ten times stronger.

5
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:30,060
It's not mine. It's him who changes the strength of our abilities.
